.* DSPDTAARA: a data area's attributes and value.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Quartz Systems 2026
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 52'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=OFFCL BASETYPE='ZONED 4 0'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=DTAARA CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DTALIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DTATYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DTALEN CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DTATEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=OFFSET CLASS=OFFCL.
:VAR NAME=VALUE CLASS=VALCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=VALUES VARS='OFFSET VALUE'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPDTAARA KEYL=KEYS HELP=DSPDTAAH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Data Area
:DATA DEPTH=6.
:DATAC.Data area . . . . . . . :   &DTAARA.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAC.Library . . . . . . . :     &DTALIB.
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.Type  . . . . . . . . . :   &DTATYPE.
:DATAC.Length  . . . . . . . . :   &DTALEN.
:DATAC.Text  . . . . . . . . . :   &DTATEXT.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=VALUES SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OFFSET' VAR=OFFSET USAGE=OUTPUT.Offset
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/VALUE' VAR=VALUE USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=13.Value  *...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPDTAAH.Display Data Area - Help
:P.The data area's type, length and text, then its value: fifty
characters a line from the offset shown, or the number of a decimal
data area.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OFFSET'.Offset
:P.The offset of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/VALUE'.Value  *...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5
:P.The value *...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5 of each
entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
